WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.800
Hi, I'm Maya, and welcome to the Vegan Dairy Guide!

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.900
For a lot of people going Vegan, dairy is the hardest part,

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.600
and it was for me too, so we broke it all down for you.

4
00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:17.330
The brands to buy, how to swap dairy when you cook,

5
00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:22.630
cookbooks, and chefs who make delicious Vegan dairy.

6
00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:25.930
It's all right here, in one place.

7
00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.650
And this is a living guide.

8
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.750
We keep adding new resources, so it won't go stale.

9
00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:34.950
When you join, you become part of the Vegans Explore community.

10
00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:38.580
Already a member? Thank you!

11
00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.480
This guide comes with your membership.

12
00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:46.880
So take a look around, and if it feels right, join us.

13
00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.080
See you on the other side!
